i/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority.mdx",{"_69":131,"_76":86,"_71":132,"_80":133,"_89":-7,"_12":134,"_91":135},"es:platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate.mdx","Emite y verifica un certificado","Emite un certificado de cliente y comprueba contenido, cadena y correspondencia de clave.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate",{"_93":136},"platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate.mdx",{"_69":138,"_76":114,"_89":-7,"_71":139},"es:_1","Conceptos",{"_69":141,"_76":86,"_71":142,"_80":143,"_89":-7,"_12":144,"_91":145},"es:platform/pki/concepts/trust-model.mdx","Modelo de confianza","Entiende dónde nace la confianza, cómo se distribuye y qué valida cada componente.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model",{"_93":146},"platform/pki/concepts/trust-model.mdx",{"_69":148,"_76":86,"_71":149,"_80":150,"_89":-7,"_12":151,"_91":152},"es:platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle.mdx","Ciclo de vida de un certificado","Emisión, uso, renovación, revocación y retirada de certificados en Lamassu.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle",{"_93":153},"platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle.mdx",{"_69":155,"_76":114,"_89":-7,"_71":156},"es:_2","Claves, autoridades y certificados",{"_69":158,"_76":86,"_71":159,"_80":160,"_89":-7,"_12":161,"_91":162},"es:platform/pki/key-management.mdx","Claves y motores criptográficos","Genera, importa y opera claves sin acoplar la PKI a un proveedor concreto.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/pki/key-management",{"_93":163},"platform/pki/key-management.mdx",{"_69":165,"_76":86,"_71":166,"_80":167,"_89":-7,"_12":168,"_91":169},"es:platform/pki/certificate-authorities.mdx","Autoridades","Crea, importa y opera las autoridades que establecen la confianza de tu PKI.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/platform/pki/certificate-authorities",{"_93":170},"platform/pki/certificate-authorities.mdx",{"_69":172,"_76":86,"_71":173,"_80":174,"_89":-7,"_12":175,"_91":176},"es