urada de Lamassu IoT en Amazon EC2.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/deployment/aws-marketplace",{"_93":532},"deployment/aws-marketplace.mdx",{"_69":534,"_76":86,"_71":535,"_80":536,"_89":-7,"_12":537,"_91":538},"es:deployment/saas.mdx","Utiliza Lamassu como SaaS","Consume Lamassu como servicio gestionado sin operar infraestructura propia.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/deployment/saas",{"_93":539},"deployment/saas.mdx","es:deployment",{"_228":542},"deployment/meta.json","<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/images/kubernetes.svg\"/><img src=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/images/kubernetes.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;vertical-align:middle;flex-shrink:0;object-fit:contain\"/>",{"_76":77,"_71":545,"_78":29,"_79":-7,"_80":546,"_82":-7,"_73":547,"_69":555,"_91":556,"_89":558},"Actualizaciones","Guía de versión a versión para el operador",[548],{"_69":549,"_76":86,"_71":550,"_80":551,"_89":-7,"_12":552,"_91":553},"es:upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0.mdx","3.8.0 a 4.0.0","Qué cambia en la arquitectura de 4.0.0, qué cambios rompen un despliegue 3.8.0, cómo actualizar paso a paso una release de Helm y cómo validar el resultado.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0",{"_93":554},"upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0.mdx","es:upgrades",{"_228":557},"upgrades/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-arrow-up shrink-0 text-[#c8861f]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 12-4-4-4 4\"></path><path d=\"M12 16V8\"></path></svg>",{"_69":560,"_76":86,"_71":561,"_80":562,"_89":-7,"_12":563,"_91":564},"es:security.mdx","Seguridad","Cómo reportar de forma privada una vulnerabilidad de seguridad en Lamassu, qué incluir en el reporte y qué releases reciben correcciones de seguridad.","/docs/pr-preview/